  "text": "Stop keeping your entire business livelihood trapped on a single creator or e-commerce platform. Building a digital store without an offsite backup strategy puts your monthly income at severe risk. Platform terms change overnight, leaving solo entrepreneurs stranded without customer contact history or store assets. Connect storefront webhooks to AWS S3 to archive every digital product asset and customer invoice automatically. This de-risks your side hustle and protects your revenue.",
